<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said it qualified for insurance the following seven municipal bond issues slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Perry Public School, Mich., $2.4 million of school building bonds.</p>
<p>--Arlington CSD, N.Y., $20 million of school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Syosset CSD, N.Y., $8.3 million of school district bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
